hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"342","[AI-translation] Hazrat Shaddad bin Aus (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Fath [Makkah] ke zamane mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath tha; Aap ne ek aadmi ko dekha jo Ramadan ki guzri hui atharah raaton par [atharahwin ko] pichhne lagwa raha tha, to Aap ne farmaya, jabke Aap mera hath pakde hue the: 'Pichhne lagwane wale aur lagwalanewale ka roza toot gaya.'"
"343","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: 'Pichhne lagwane wale aur lagwalanewale ka roza toot gaya.'"
"344","[AI-translation] Miqsam, Ibn Abbas ke aazad karda ghulam (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne pichhne lagwae jabke Aap rozedar aur ehram wale the."
